Package: blockr.jsblock
Title: Scaffold for a JS-Driven blockr Plot Block
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Your", "Name", , "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A minimal, working blockr plot block built the JS-driven way:
    a JavaScript class owns the control UI (via the shared Blockr
    components), R turns the JSON state into a ggplot2 expression. Copy
    this package, rename it, and turn the myplot block into the
    visualization you actually want. Tests are green from the first
    commit -- keep them green.
